Third-party data referenced by this project (not part of the licensed work)

  SponsorBlock (https://sponsor.ajay.app), CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
  The pipeline does not use SponsorBlock data and does not need it. The
  project used community sponsor segments only as an external reference
  point when evaluating its own host-read timings on a handful of episodes
  (research log, track L). No SponsorBlock data ships in this repository or
  in the package; the "sponsorblock" export format is a file layout, not
  data. Anyone reproducing that evaluation obtains the segments from
  SponsorBlock under its own licence, for evaluation only.

  Megaphone stitch maps. The x-megaphone-payload-2 response header is
  published by the hosting service with every audio response; the project
  records the decoded byte offsets of the copy it transcribed as factual
  timing labels. No audio or transcript of any third-party episode is in
  this repository.
